  "description": "The package is designed for caching data in .NET applications. \n        It provides a generalized interface for working with an in-memory cache, making it easy to save, retrieve, and delete data. \n        It includes an in-memory cache implementation with support for configuring cache lifetime. \n        In the future, it is planned to add additional classes and interfaces related to caching to expand the functionality.",
